    "3": {
      "caption": "Performance comparison of Kimi-K2-Instruct against leading open-source and proprietary models across diverse tasks. <strong>Bold</strong> denotes the global SOTA; <u><strong>underlined bold</strong></u> indicates the best open-source result. Data points marked with * are taken directly from the model's technical report or blog.",
